                        </a>
                        <div class="post-inner">
                            <div>
                                <h3 itemprop="name" style="display:contents;">
                                    <a class="post-title" href="https://news.nextapple.com/entertainment/20261019/5C4A3B16DDBAF2733C6A6E99A53B7B55">黃莑茗巡演最終場被直擊「見網友」　羞認：他主動私訊的</a>
                                </h3>
                                <p>【記者王郁惠／台北報導】男團AcQUA源少年隊長黃莑茗，昨（18日）於台北女巫店舉辦首次個人巡演《哎呀！跌個狗吃屎！Mini Tour》最終場，沒想到最後一曲唱完，歌迷仍連續喊了3、4分鐘安可，讓根本沒準備安可曲的他哭笑不得，只能笑喊：「我真的沒有準備啦！」最後也向歌迷喊話，希望明年有機會再辦巡演。</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <div class="category entertainment">娛樂時尚</div>
                                <time datetime="2026-10-19T18:51:00+08:00">2026/10/19 18:51</time>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                                                        <article class="post-style1" itemscope="" itemprop="post">
                                                <a href="https://news.nextapple.com/local/20261019/2EECDA1016A3928163FDEA64305955CC">
                            <figure>
                                                                    <img data-src="https://static-cdn.nextapple.tw/prod/2026-10/2EECDA1016A3928163FDEA64305955CC/0cd03da5000dbd5958c7b3b0bbe75959_512.webp" alt="金曲歌手謝震廷終於出庭　當庭聲請指定辯護人！庭訊僅花10分鐘" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=">
                                                                                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 51 51" style="position: absolute; right: 10px; bottom: 10px; width: 40px; opacity: 0.8;">
                                    <path id="_Color" d="M25.5,51A25.5,25.5,0,1,1,51,25.5,25.529,25.529,0,0,1,25.5,51ZM15.3,22.95l10.2,10.2,10.2-10.2Z" transform="translate(0 51) rotate(-90)" fill="#fff"/>
                                    </svg>
                                                            </figure>
                        </a>
                        <div class="post-inner">
                            <div>
                                <h3 itemprop="name" style="display:contents;">
                                    <a class="post-title" href="https://news.nextapple.com/local/20261019/2EECDA1016A3928163FDEA64305955CC">金曲歌手謝震廷終於出庭　當庭聲請指定辯護人！庭訊僅花10分鐘</a>
                                </h3>
                                <p>【記者張欽／台北報導】金曲最佳新人歌手謝震廷被控與前女友發生口角時亮刀恐嚇，遭北檢依恐嚇、強制、公然侮辱及《個資法》等罪起訴，還一度遭通緝。台北地院審理時也屢傳未到，5萬元保釋金也被沒入，今天開庭時他終於現身．但拒絕脫帽受審，對是否認罪也暫不答辯，表示身心狀況不好無法答辯，並當庭聲請指定辯護人，確認有辯護人後再答辯，法官當庭諭知會審酌是否符合指定辯護人資格，庭訊僅10分鐘結束。</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <div class="category local">社會</div>
                                <time datetime="2026-10-19T18:47:00+08:00">2026/10/19 18:47</time>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                                                        <article class="post-style1" itemscope="" itemprop="post">
                                                <a href="https://news.nextapple.com/politics/20261019/D8815267D4C2324C015526DB8BC54DB9">
                            <figure>
                                                                    <img data-src="https://static-cdn.nextapple.tw/prod/2026-10/D8815267D4C2324C015526DB8BC54DB9/6b7e86e73c29d313bdc99f8ee1ab010d_512.webp" alt="蔣萬安今上《戰情室》　談長子成熟「遭抹黑沒一句埋怨」" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=">
                                                                                            </figure>
                        </a>
                        <div class="post-inner">
                            <div>
                                <h3 itemprop="name" style="display:contents;">
                                    <a class="post-title" href="https://news.nextapple.com/politics/20261019/D8815267D4C2324C015526DB8BC54DB9">蔣萬安今上《戰情室》　談長子成熟「遭抹黑沒一句埋怨」</a>
                                </h3>
                                <p>【施養正／綜合報導】台北市長蔣萬安19日接受《少康戰情室》節目專訪，被問及先前長子蔣得立遭質疑特權一事。蔣萬安透露，兒子私下完全沒有一句埋怨，還反過來安慰爸媽不用擔心。</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <div class="category politics">政治</div>
                                <time datetime="2026-10-19T18:45:00+08:00">2026/10/19 18:45</time>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                                                        <article class="post-style1" itemscope="" itemprop="post">
                                                <a href="https://news.nextapple.com/sports/20261019/0AC3BBA912B86BC81AA80179170B3C04">
                            <figure>
                                                                    <img data-src="https://static-cdn.nextapple.tw/prod/2026-10/0AC3BBA912B86BC81AA80179170B3C04/561b089ab702bea0da959539fe43f743_512.webp" alt="蕭翔文名古屋亞帕運衛冕跆拳道金牌　賴清德致電申賀！" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=">
                                                                                            </figure>
                        </a>
                        <div class="post-inner">
                            <div>
                                <h3 itemprop="name" style="display:contents;">
                                    <a class="post-title" href="https://news.nextapple.com/sports/20261019/0AC3BBA912B86BC81AA80179170B3C04">蕭翔文名古屋亞帕運衛冕跆拳道金牌　賴清德致電申賀！</a>
                                </h3>
                                <p>【李家穎／綜合報導】帕拉跆拳道蕭翔文選手參加2026年第5屆愛知名古屋亞洲帕拉運動會（亞帕運）發揮最佳實力，於19日奪得跆拳道男子K44級58公斤量級金牌。賴清德總統在獲知喜訊後，於第一時間拍發賀電肯定選手優異表現，並鼓勵我國代表隊選手持續奮戰，為自己及國家爭取最高榮耀。</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <div class="category sports">體育</div>
                                <time datetime="2026-10-19T18:42:00+08:00">2026/10/19 18:42</time>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
