                                                <a href="https://news.nextapple.com/entertainment/20261019/E892518033457D47B645F2E3874AAEDD">
                            <figure>
                                                                    <img data-src="https://static-cdn.nextapple.tw/prod/2026-10/E892518033457D47B645F2E3874AAEDD/7fc5e5d73de3744e723c116062e6c02f_512.webp" alt="亞歷山卓萬聖節髮飾好Q　粉紅骷髏、水晶南瓜優雅搞怪" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=">
                                                                                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 51 51" style="position: absolute; right: 10px; bottom: 10px; width: 40px; opacity: 0.8;">
                                    <path id="_Color" d="M25.5,51A25.5,25.5,0,1,1,51,25.5,25.529,25.529,0,0,1,25.5,51ZM15.3,22.95l10.2,10.2,10.2-10.2Z" transform="translate(0 51) rotate(-90)" fill="#fff"/>
                                    </svg>
                                                            </figure>
                        </a>
                        <div class="post-inner">
                            <div>
                                <h3 itemprop="name" style="display:contents;">
                                    <a class="post-title" href="https://news.nextapple.com/entertainment/20261019/E892518033457D47B645F2E3874AAEDD">亞歷山卓萬聖節髮飾好Q　粉紅骷髏、水晶南瓜優雅搞怪</a>
                                </h3>
                                <p>【記者劉旻君／台北報導】再過兩個禮拜即將迎來萬聖節，法國精品髮飾亞歷山卓（Alexandre de Paris）也推出全新2026萬聖節限定系列髮飾，包括南瓜笑臉、黑貓、蝙蝠等元素都融入設計，連骷髏頭都換上粉紅外衣並綴滿水晶，讓搞怪萬聖節造型也能散發法式優雅氣息。</p>
                            </div>
